{"id": 8356980, "full_name": "Brian T. Emmer", "first_name": "Brian T.", "last_name": "Emmer", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://plos.figshare.com/articles/figure/ACE2_regulators_influence_cellular_sensitivity_to_SARS-CoV-2_infection_/19287302", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p>(A) Percentage of either wild-type or CRISPR-targeted cells with positive staining for SARS-CoV-2 nucleocapsid protein at 2 days post-infection with SARS-CoV-2 at MOI 1. An average of 214 fields of view (range 151\u2013295) were analyzed for each condition over 2 independent biologic replicates. Error bars indicate standard deviation. (B) Infectious titers of cellular supernatants collected at 2 days post-infection with SARS-CoV-2 at MOI 1, plotted as log<sub>10</sub>(TCID50) with error bars indicating standard deviation. For both experiments, asterisks indicate <i>p</i> < 0.05 relative to nontargeting controls by Student\u2019s t-test.</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 161608, "created_date": "2022-03-01T18:39:55Z", "modified_date": "2023-06-08T08:43:28Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["viral spike protein", "throughput crispr screens", "suggest potential targets", "influence cellular susceptibility", "immortalized cell lines", "established transcription factors", "cell type specificity", "3 cells revealed", "host factors involved", "derived huh7 cells", "div >< p", "ace2 regulatory networks", "ace2 modifiers comprised", "ace2 surface abundance", "host cells", "surface abundance", "functional networks", "functional modifiers", "derived calu", "regulate ace2", "ace2 regulators", "ace2 expression", "ace2 </", "vivo </", "ugp2 </", "smad4 </", "report high", "pias1